# User Personas

## Persona 1: Healthcare Operations Manager (Primary ICP)

### Dr. Priya Sharma

Role: Operations Manager, Multi-Specialty Clinic

Age: 38

Team Size: 30 Doctors + 20 Support Staff

### Goals
- Reduce missed appointments
- Improve patient engagement
- Reduce administrative workload
- Improve follow-up compliance

### Pain Points
- High volume of patient calls
- Appointment reminder workload
- Staff shortages
- Missed follow-ups

### Why She Buys Vocallabs
- Automated appointment reminders
- AI-powered patient follow-ups
- 24/7 patient support
- Reduced receptionist workload

### Success Metrics
- No-show reduction
- Appointment booking rate
- Patient satisfaction
- Staff hours saved

